        <Positioned left="0" top="0" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#0EA5E9">1</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  ImageFiltered 对子树结果做滤镜，会自动按 sigma 提供模糊输出边界。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="37" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#7C3AED">2</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  ColorFiltered 在绘制边界可确定时限定作用范围，合法溢出与阴影都包含在内。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="74" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#F59E0B">3</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  BackdropFilter 背后必须有已绘制内容，并用 ClipRRect 限定区域才看得见。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="111" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#10B981">4</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  自检顺序：布局数值断言 > 像素采样 > Golden > Artifact；Artifact 不是断言。]]></Raw>
    </Text>
        </Positioned>
        <Positioned left="0" top="148" width="1104" height="31">
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC,Inter" fontSize="24" color="#0F172A" height="1.35">
        <Text fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" fontSize="22"
              color="#EF4444">5</Text>
        <Raw><![CDATA[  可复现：固定字体与颜色空间，网络图片先转本地资源，不把时间与随机数写入图像。]]></Raw>
